{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Locn3Lc6qGe42RydbYVT5j","type":"tool_result","content":"1527\talmanac_harden_run_finalize() {\n1528\t  local root=\"$1\"\n1529\t  local run_id=\"$2\"\n1530\t  local status=\"$3\"\n1531\t\n1532\t  trap - EXIT INT TERM\n1533\t  [ -n \"$run_id\" ] || return 0\n1534\t  almanac_loop_mark_run_status \"$root\" \"$run_id\" \"$status\" >/dev/null 2>&1 || true\n1535\t}\n1536\t\n1537\talmanac_harden_consume_stop() {\n1538\t  local root=\"$1\"\n1539\t  local file\n1540\t\n1541\t  file=\"$(almanac_loop_run_control_file harden \"$root\" stop)\" || return 1\n1542\t  [ -f \"$file\" ] || return 1\n1543\t  rm -f \"$file\"\n1544\t  return 0\n1545\t}\n1546\t\n1547\talmanac_harden_consume_steer() {\n1548\t  local root=\"$1\"\n1549\t  local file\n1550\t\n1551\t  file=\"$(almanac_loop_run_control_file harden \"$root\" steer)\" || return 1\n1552\t  [ -f \"$file\" ] || return 1\n1553\t  cat \"$file\"\n1554\t  rm -f \"$file\"\n1555\t  return 0\n1556\t}\n1557\t\n1558\t# Drive the convergence loop: repeat almanac_harden_round under the gate until\n1559\t# the target converges, the round budget is exhausted, or the human ships.\n1560\t# Budget is configurable (3rd arg, else HARDEN_ROUND_BUDGET, else 5). Each round\n1561\t# prints its kill-list and a verdict. Returns 0 when converged or shipped, 1 when\n1562\t# the budget is hit without convergence (clear NON-CONVERGED status).\n1563\t#\n1564\t# Between rounds the human can steer at the HITL checkpoint: a steer directive\n1565\t# (echoed by almanac_harden_hitl_checkpoint, captured here) is carried forward and\n1566\t# threaded into every subsequent round's reviewers and fixer, so the operator can\n1567\t# redirect the run without babysitting each worker. An optional starting directive\n1568\t# (4th arg) seeds the first round; the checkpoint's own directive (HARDEN_STEER /\n1569\t# the gum prompt) overrides it from the next round on.\n1570\t#\n1571\t# The loop registers itself in the shared run registry at start (the same contract\n1572\t# ralph emits, so it shows in the almanac hub), updates its live run-status blob\n1573\t# each round (round + lens/open-blocking summary), and marks the run done (converge\n1574\t# or ship), failed (budget hit), or aborted (signal / mid-round _die) on exit.\n1575\talmanac_harden_run() {\n1576\t  local root=\"$1\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G1XmY5XvTbbUFYvBrgo6G5","session_id":"3ef28929-b60b-453b-bba1-b6ef6c6d207d","uuid":"47e1ccc2-8a70-494f-a27b-54e9663f2bb7","timestamp":"2026-05-27T07:04:10.858Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Codebase friction exploration"}
